<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">neural-toxin</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Neural Toxin</ansi> spell injects psionic venom into the target's mind,
establishing a sustained pattern that deals damage over several rounds.
The toxin bypasses physical defenses, attacking the target's mental
and vital systems directly.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast neural-toxin [target]</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Harm Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Mental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 5
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 45
  <ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> Mental — willpower resists the initial injection
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Psionic damage over time — persists for several rounds

